 border-[#262626] pl-4 py-1\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase text-[#888888] block mb-1\'>Policy Update</span> <h4 class=\'text-sm font-medium text-white\'>New regulation standards for EU AI Act</h4> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'h-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col bg-[#0D0D0E] border-t border-[#262626]\'> <h2 class=\'text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white mb-6\'>Collective Brain</h2> <div class=\'space-y-6\'> <div class=\'flex gap-4\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#262626] flex-shrink-0\'></div> <div> <p class=\'text-xs text-white font-semibold\'>@quant_master</p> <p class=\'text-[11px] text-[#888888] mt-1\'>Anyone have tips on reducing quantization loss for the Llama-3-70B on 4-bit?</p> <div class=\'flex gap-3 mt-2\'> <span class=\'text-[9px] text-white uppercase opacity-50\'>12 Replies</span> <span class=\'text-[9px] text-white uppercase opacity-50 underline\'>Join Discussion</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-4\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#262626] flex-shrink-0\'></div> <div> <p class=\'text-xs text-white font-semibold\'>@neural_architect</p> <p class=\'text-[11px] text-[#888888] mt-1\'>Just uploaded a new RAG pipeline for medical data. Review and testing needed.</p> <div class=\'flex gap-3 mt-2\'> <span class=\'text-[9px] text-white uppercase opacity-50\'>5 Reviews</span> <span class=\'text-[9px] text-white uppercase opacity-50 underline\'>View Post</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </main> <footer class=\'h-12 border-t border-[#262626] px-8 flex items-center justify-between bg-[#0A0A0B] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#555] shrink-0\'> <div>&copy; 2024 Neural Nexus Marketplace. Secure Gateway Active.</div> <div class=\'flex gap-6\'> <span>System Status: Optimal</span> <span>Market Volatility: Low</span> <span>Verified Builders: 1,429</span> </div> </footer> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backg