    thinking: "**Defining Application Structure**\n\nI\'m now structuring the application, creating modular types. I\'m focusing on mock databases synced with `localStorage` for data persistence. This approach will ensure user-listed items, community reviews, purchases, and news bookmarks survive between sessions. API integrations and component design are the next key steps.\n\n\n**Structuring Marketplace Assets**\n\nI\'m deep in the design of the `MarketplaceAsset` type now. I\'ve defined its core properties, including data on price, creators, stats, and specs. I\'ve also incorporated preview data, download links, and a featured flag. My focus is on ensuring comprehensive representation of marketplace assets within the application. I am thinking of including Community Post type as well.\n\n\n**Defining Community Interaction**\n\nI\'m now outlining data structures for community posts, detailing types like \"Model Review,\" \"Bug Report,\" and \"Showcase.\" Each will feature content, code snippets, tags, upvotes, replies, and timestamps. I\'m focusing on reply structures, with author details and upvotes. The goal is to facilitate rich, interactive discussions within the platform.\n\n\n"
