          text: "    summary: \'High-risk AI system providers must now register model documentation, training data provenance, and automated red-teaming logs in European central repository.\',"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    fullArticle: \'Brussels, Belgium \342\200\224 The European Artificial Intelligence Office has activated its online portal for high-risk system compliance. Developers hosting generative models for legal, medical, and financial automated decision-making must submit watermarking protocols and toxicity evaluation benchmarks.\',"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
