    thinking: "**Confirming Code Completion**\n\nThe code is now fully compiled and linted, yielding no errors, and all specifications, particularly the sophisticated dark theme, are implemented using the monochrome palette. I have also verified that the application\'s responsiveness is optimal across diverse screen sizes. The documentation is also completed.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built **Neural Nexus**, a dark-mode AI marketplace, community, directory, and daily news platform styled strictly in accordance with the **Sophisticated Dark** visual aesthetic.\n\n### Key Features Implemented\n\n- **Sophisticated Dark Theme**: Framed by a `#0A0A0B` deep dark canvas, `#0D0D0E` navbar, `#121214` card surfaces, crisp `#262626` borders, Playfair Display serif headlines (*\"Curated Intelligence\"*, *\"Collective Brain\"*), JetBrains Mono typography, and matrix green `#00FF41` metric accents.\n- **AI Marketplace**: \n  - Buy & sell LLM fine-tunes, agentic workflows, LoRAs, chatbot templates, and security guardrails.\n  - Filter by category, price (Free vs Paid), downloads, and rating.\n  - Interactive **Demo Sandbox & Playground** to test sample inputs and run execution tests directly inside the model details view.\n  - **Creator Portal**: Modal form allowing users to publish their own AI models or workflows to the marketplace.\n- **Secure Payment Gateway & Access Vault**:\n  - Checkout modal with Credit Card and Crypto (USDT, SOL, ETH) payment simulation.\n  - Instant generation of unique Vault License Keys (e.g. `NN-VAULT-8942-F9A1`) and direct package downloads.\n  - Personal **Access Vault** drawer to manage acquired license keys and API endpoints.\n- **Community Review & Enhancement Network**:\n  - Open peer review community where developers share new models, benchmark perplexity scores, and post code snippets.\n  - **Automated AI Reviewer**: Instant automated code review and architectural optimization tips generated for submitted posts.\n  - Upvote counters, thread reply discussions, and model submission modal.\n- **Global AI Internet Directory**:\n  - Universal index of top AI models and developer tools (Gemini 1.5 Pro, DeepSeek R1, Claude 3.5 Sonnet, Flux.1, Llama 3.3, Cursor, ElevenLabs, LangChain).\n  - Detailed specs breakdown including context window length, parameters count, open-source vs proprietary licensing, pricing, and direct official site links.\n- **Daily AI News Channel**:\n  - Live AI news ticker running across the header with real-time updates.\n  - Categorized news feed covering Hardware Clusters, Model Weight Drops, EU AI Act Policy, and Open Source Releases.\n  - **AI Audio News Synthesizer**: Interactive speech synthesis button that generates and reads out executive daily briefings."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 210930843
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
